# OPENLOGI_THEME is an OpenLogi theme display name. User theme JSON files live
# under ~/.config/openlogi/themes; Drive is installed there from this repo.
# BORDERS_COLOR is the JankyBorders active-window border, as 0xAARRGGBB.

